# The X-cards that differ under the IBM dialect (`-std=ibm`), laid over exec85.cards by number (1.2).
# X-cards are implementor-names, so they belong to the profile (P-12): IBM's switches are UPSI-0 to
# UPSI-7, and `cobc -std=ibm` refuses SWITCH-1 as a system-name. UPSI-n is cobc's runtime switch n.
# switches: X-51 must be ON at run time and X-52 OFF (Appendix D)
X-051   UPSI-0.
X-052   UPSI-1.
